{
  "dsl": "octos.lesson",
  "version": "0.1",
  "profile": "authoring",
  "lesson": {
    "mode": "explain",
    "language": "zh-CN",
    "title": "截距与斜率的辨析：从 y=2x+5 看交点",
    "goals": [
      "澄清直线 y=2x+5 中截距与斜率的对应关系",
      "理解截距的几何含义是直线与坐标轴的交点位置数值"
    ],
    "adaptation": {
      "strategies": [
        "先明确确认学生算式的分歧点：2 是斜率而非截距",
        "通过令 x=0 求交点的值，建立截距的直观与代数统一"
      ]
    },
    "variables": [
      {
        "as": "number_01",
        "initial": 5,
        "min": -10,
        "max": 10,
        "label": "常数项b",
        "control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.1
        }
      }
    ],
    "tasks": [
      {
        "as": "section-01-task-01",
        "prompt": "如果把常数项调整为 3，直线的 y 截距就会变成 3。试着把滑块滑动到 3 观察交点的变化。",
        "availability": {
          "kind": "after_lesson"
        },
        "hints": [
          "常数项 b 对应直线与 y 轴的交点位置。",
          "将参数调为 3，直线会向下平移，交于 (0, 3)。"
        ],
        "hint_after_attempts": 2,
        "success_message": "很好，此时直线与 y 轴的交点就是 3，这就是新的 y 截距！",
        "allowed_operations": [
          {
            "kind": "variable_change",
            "variable": "number_01",
            "controls": [
              "slider"
            ]
          }
        ],
        "completion": {
          "kind": "expression_target",
          "expression": "number_01",
          "value": 3,
          "tolerance": 0.05
        },
        "start": {
          "kind": "practice",
          "variables": [
            "number_01"
          ]
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "key": "section-01",
      "purpose": "直接纠正对 2 的混淆，解释 y 截距是令 x=0 时 y 的值，即 5",
      "beats": [
        {
          "key": "moment-01",
          "say": "这是一个值得收藏的问题。我们先直接对答案：算 2 是不对的。你关注到了式子里的数字 2，这很自然，但分歧点在于：2 是斜率，而不是截距。",
          "delivery": "patient",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
              "kind": "plot",
              "role": "main_visual",
              "content": {
                "title": "y = 2x + n1",
                "axes": {
                  "x": {
                    "min": -4,
                    "max": 4,
                    "label": "x"
                  },
                  "y": {
                    "min": -5,
                    "max": 15,
                    "label": "y"
                  }
                },
                "curves": [
                  {
                    "as": "primary-curve",
                    "expression": "((2)*(x))+(number_01)",
                    "label": "y = 2x + 5"
                  }
                ],
                "points": [
                  {
                    "as": "reference-a",
                    "x": 0,
                    "y": 5,
                    "label": "A"
                  },
                  {
                    "as": "reference-b",
                    "x": 1,
                    "y": 7,
                    "label": "B"
                  }
                ],
                "bindings": [
                  {
                    "target": "reference-a.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(0))+(number_01)"
                  },
                  {
                    "target": "reference-b.y",
                    "expression": "((2)*(1))+(number_01)"
                  }
                ],
                "measurement": "secant",
                "sample_input": "fixed_x"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "new_region",
                "region_role": "section-01"
              },
              "when": "before_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-01-item-02",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "y = mx + b"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
              },
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-02",
          "say": "所谓 y 截距，几何上就是直线与 y 轴交点的位置。在 y 轴上，横坐标 x 一定是 0。我们把 x = 0 代入直线方程：y 等于 2 乘以 0 加上 5，结果直接就是 5。",
          "delivery": "careful",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-02-item-01",
              "kind": "math",
              "role": "derivation",
              "content": {
                "latex": "x = 0 \\implies y = 2(0) + 5 = 5"
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-01-item-02"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            },
            {
              "do": "focus",
              "targets": [
                "section-01-moment-01-item-01",
                "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              ],
              "intent": "强调交点 (0, 5)",
              "when": "after_speech"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "moment-03",
          "say": "所以，直线和 y 轴相交于点 (0, 5)，它的 y 截距是 5。而你刚才看的 2，是直线的斜率，它描述的是横坐标每增加 1，纵坐标增加 2。常数项 5 才是截距。",
          "delivery": "encouraging",
          "actions": [
            {
              "do": "write",
              "as": "section-01-moment-03-item-01",
              "kind": "note",
              "role": "explanation",
              "content": {
                "title": "斜截式辨析",
                "items": [
                  "斜率 m = 2（变化率）",
                  "y 截距 b = 5（与 y 轴交点纵坐标）"
                ]
              },
              "place": {
                "relation": "below",
                "anchor": "section-01-moment-02-item-01"
              },
              "when": "during_speech"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "close": {
    "summary": "在一次函数 y=mx+b 中，x 前面的系数 2 是直线的斜率，控制倾斜程度；常数项 5 才是 y 截距，代表直线与 y 轴交点的纵坐标。",
    "focus": [
      "section-01-moment-01-item-01"
    ]
  }
}
